CLASSIFIED MISSION FILE -- ABDUCTION OF THE KAZEKAGE AND EXTRACTION OF THE ONE-TAIL
Kazekage Office. Highest seal. Cross-ref: Gaara rescue operation.

Subject: The Akatsuki assault upon Sunagakure, the capture of Lord Gaara, and
the extraction of Shukaku, the One-Tail.

Sequence:
- The Akatsuki member Deidara, wielder of explosive clay, infiltrated the
  village by air and engaged Lord Gaara directly above Sunagakure. The Kazekage
  defended the village to the last, shielding it with his sand even in defeat.
- Gaara was subdued and abducted. His partner Sasori of the Red Sand, himself a
  Sand defector, aided the operation.
- The Akatsuki performed the sealing ritual to extract the One-Tail from its
  host -- a process fatal to the jinchuriki.

Outcome: Lord Gaara was recovered by a joint Sand-Leaf effort and, through the
sacrifice of the honored elder Chiyo, restored to life. The extraction of the
tailed beast, however, could not be undone. This incident is the clearest
warning of the Akatsuki threat to the village. Retained under permanent seal.
